{"id":"2e9f1ba8e2364241","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-inclusion-chain.md","title":"复杂性类包含链","display":"thm-inclusion-chain — 复杂性类包含链","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-inclusion-chain","aliases":["29-thm-inclusion-chain"],"display":"thm-inclusion-chain — 复杂性类包含链","depends_on":["[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","[[29-df-circuit-classes]]","[[29-df-nc]]","[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","[[29-df-ph]]","[[29-df-ordering]]"],"source_locator":"§2.2; Definition 5.17 and §5.4, pp.26,80–84, DjVu scans 41,95–99","source_basis":"原书资源及一致性约定；包含链为本地标准模拟推导"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-inclusion-chain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-inclusion-chain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-inclusion-chain — 复杂性类包含链"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6b1e7a4a516bab79\" href=\"?note=6b1e7a4a516bab79\" title=\"29-df-circuit-classes\">29-df-circuit-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a1359bbd5a5c2a70\" href=\"?note=a1359bbd5a5c2a70\" title=\"29-df-nc\">29-df-nc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9120c20ece14d350\" href=\"?note=9120c20ece14d350\" title=\"29-df-ph\">29-df-ph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§2.2; Definition 5.17 and §5.4, pp.26,80–84, DjVu scans 41,95–99"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书资源及一致性约定；包含链为本地标准模拟推导"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为固定有限关系输入词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\notin\\tau\">\\(&lt;\\notin\\tau\\)</span>；各类均在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 上采用同一输入编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=(A,L)\">\\(U=(A,L)\\)</span> 的结构扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\">\\(\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NC}^i[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{NC}^i[\\tau]\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{NC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6b1e7a4a516bab79\" href=\"?note=6b1e7a4a516bab79\" title=\"29-df-circuit-classes\">29-df-circuit-classes</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a1359bbd5a5c2a70\" href=\"?note=a1359bbd5a5c2a70\" title=\"29-df-nc\">29-df-nc</a> 的一阶一致电路类。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm L^{&lt;}[\\tau],\\mathrm{NL}^{&lt;}[\\tau],\\mathrm P^{&lt;}[\\tau],\\mathrm{NP}^{&lt;}[\\tau],\\mathrm{PSPACE}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm L^{&lt;}[\\tau],\\mathrm{NL}^{&lt;}[\\tau],\\mathrm P^{&lt;}[\\tau],\\mathrm{NP}^{&lt;}[\\tau],\\mathrm{PSPACE}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PH}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}]\">\\(\\mathrm{PH}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"9120c20ece14d350\" href=\"?note=9120c20ece14d350\" title=\"29-df-ph\">29-df-ph</a>，其有序输入限制在下式给出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PH}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\{U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\in S\\}\\mid S\\in\\mathrm{PH}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PH}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\{U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\in S\\}\\mid S\\in\\mathrm{PH}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NC}^1[\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathrm L^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathrm{NL}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathrm{NC}^2[\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathrm{NC}[\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathrm P^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathrm{NP}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathrm{PH}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathrm{PSPACE}^{&lt;}[\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NC}^1[\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathrm L^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathrm{NL}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathrm{NC}^2[\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathrm{NC}[\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathrm P^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathrm{NP}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathrm{PH}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathrm{PSPACE}^{&lt;}[\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条汇集原书 §2.2 与 §5.4 的标准包含关系；电路统一采用 Definition 5.17 的一阶一致性。以固定词汇参数对齐各边，避免原条只定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{NC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 却使用裸 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NC}\">\\(\\mathrm{NC}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NC}^1\\subseteq\\mathrm L\">\\(\\mathrm{NC}^1\\subseteq\\mathrm L\\)</span> 由对数深度有界扇入电路的逐门递归求值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{NC}^2\">\\(\\mathrm{NL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{NC}^2\\)</span> 用配置图的重复平方；一致多项式大小电路可多项式时间生成并求值；多项式交替树可用多项式空间深度优先遍历。这里的包含均不声称为严格包含。以上为本地标准模拟论证，未声称本书某一条定理逐字列出整链。</p>\n<p>本轮将 PH 的有序输入限制写为沿 O_tau 的原像，不再交叉混用结构与有序对。其余包含均沿同一机器查询接口解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-circuit-classes","status":"resolved","id":"6b1e7a4a516bab79","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-circuit-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-nc","status":"resolved","id":"a1359bbd5a5c2a70","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-nc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-complexity-classes","status":"resolved","id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ph","status":"resolved","id":"9120c20ece14d350","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ph]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ordering]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau$ 为固定有限关系输入词汇，$<\\notin\\tau$；各类均在 $\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]$ 上采用同一输入编码。$U=(A,L)$ 的结构扩张 $\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)$ 见 [[29-df-fo-q-fo]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-circuit-classes","status":"resolved","id":"6b1e7